## 📞 SUPPORT / QUESTIONS

### Si vous êtes bloqué...

**"How to find CTO email?"**
→ Hunter.io or LinkedIn message first (warmer)

**"Nobody responding!"**
→ Normal (70%+ non-response is expected)
→ Keep volume high, check spam folder

**"Don't know what to say in call?"**
→ Use exact script in "Guide_Pratique_7_Jours"
→ Listen 70%, talk 30%

**"Should I offer discount?"**
→ NO. Offer free audit instead (better conversion)

**"How many follow-ups is ok?"**
→ Max 3 (day 7, day 14, day 21 is sweet spot)

